sequenceDiagram
    title Resolution Sequence
    autonumber
    participant API as Approved Esports API
    participant OS as Oracle Service (off-chain)
    participant PM as PredictionMarket.sol
    participant RR as ResolverRegistry.sol
    actor CH as Challenger (Bettor)
    actor RV as Selected Resolvers (5)
    participant IX as Indexer + PostgreSQL
    actor BT as Bettor (winner)

    Note over PM: Trading deadline reached → market CLOSED

    OS->>API: Fetch match result (server-side API credentials)
    alt Usable result returned
        API-->>OS: Official match result
        OS->>PM: proposeOutcome(marketId, YES/NO) via authorized oracle signer
        PM->>PM: Check caller is oracle signer, state = CLOSED
        PM-->>IX: emit OutcomeProposed → state PROPOSED, challenge window opens
    else Match canceled / no contest
        API-->>OS: Match canceled
        OS->>PM: markVoid(marketId)
        PM-->>IX: emit MarketVoided → state VOID (refund rule applies)
    else API missing, delayed, or sources disagree
        OS->>PM: reportTimeout(marketId)
        PM-->>IX: emit OracleTimeout → state ORACLE_TIMEOUT, escalate to resolvers
    end

    opt Bettor disputes the proposed result (window still open)
        CH->>PM: challenge(marketId) + bond
        PM->>PM: Check window open, not already disputed
        PM-->>IX: emit OutcomeChallenged → state DISPUTED
    end

    alt No challenge before window expires
        PM->>PM: finalize(marketId) → proposed outcome accepted
    else DISPUTED or ORACLE_TIMEOUT
        PM->>RR: Select 5 eligible resolvers
        RR->>RR: Exclude market creator, oracle proposer, challenger
        RR-->>PM: Selected resolver set → state RESOLVER_VOTING
        loop Each selected resolver
            RV->>PM: vote(marketId, outcome)
            PM->>RR: isSelectedResolver(marketId, voter)?
            RR-->>PM: eligible
            PM-->>IX: emit VoteCast
        end
        PM->>PM: 3-of-5 matching votes reached → finalize with voted outcome
    end

    PM-->>IX: emit MarketFinalized → state FINALIZED / CLAIMABLE

    BT->>PM: claimPayout(marketId)
    PM->>PM: Check FINALIZED, winning shares > 0, not already claimed
    PM-->>BT: Transfer testnet-token payout
    PM-->>IX: emit PayoutClaimed
